---
layout: showcase.njk
title: Donate
permalink: /donate/
description: How to support the work.
kicker: Donate
headline: It is the heart that gives,<br>the fingers just let go.
intro: – African proverb
---
<section class="band donate-text">
<p>{{ donate.intro | replace("send me an email", '<a href="mailto:nibbidadhamma@gmail.com">send me an email</a>') | safe }}</p>
<p class="sign"><em>{{ donate.thanks }}<br>{{ donate.signature }}</em></p>
</section>
<section class="band ways">
<h2>Ways to give</h2>
{%- if donate.methods and donate.methods.length %}
<div class="way-grid">
{%- for m in donate.methods %}
<article class="way">
<h3>{{ m.title }}</h3>
<dl>
{%- for l in m.lines %}
<dt>{{ l.label }}</dt><dd>{{ l.value }}</dd>
{%- endfor %}
</dl>
{%- if m.note %}<p class="note-line">{{ m.note }}</p>{% endif %}
</article>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
{%- else %}
<p class="lead-note">To donate, or to meet in person to share some Dhamma or offer food, please <a href="mailto:nibbidadhamma@gmail.com">write to nibbidadhamma@gmail.com</a>. I will send you the details.</p>
{%- endif %}
</section>
